// macro-parenthesis-adjacency.  Measured against the established compiler.
// NO SPACE, so this IS a function-like definition - and "3.14159f" is not a
// parameter name.  The established compiler rejects the DEFINITION:
//     error C0105: Syntax error in #define
// Before this slice we said "undeclared identifier 'K'", i.e. we refused for
// a reason that had nothing to do with what is wrong.
#define K(3.14159f)
float4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR { return t * K; }
